_:N7af27b1de3ef4ec7bc4df8633faebf05 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/SafetyIntegrityLevelType/dalD> .
